[en.FOCUS_GEN_MILITARY]
Military Reform

[en.FOCUS_GEN_MILITARY_desc]
With a touch of irony, we embark on this journey, for what could be more amusing than watching a nation of harmony and friendship arm themselves to the teeth?\nPrepare to witness the birth of the Equestrian War Machine, where rainbows shoot lasers and friendship is as blinding as a thousand suns!

[zh.FOCUS_GEN_MILITARY]
军事改革

[zh.FOCUS_GEN_MILITARY_desc]
在这个充满讽刺的旅程中，我们将见证一个充满和谐与友谊的国家如何武装到牙齿。\n准备好见证小马利亚战争机器的诞生，彩虹发射激光，友谊将像上千个太阳一样耀眼！

